    | shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. |

// C, and the held chord opens to A C E; then high Bb, the flat sixth,
// alone for a bar - the darkest note in the piece, as the pickup. It is the
// original's signature, and it is not played straight: struck hard, bent up
// a whole tone at once, held on the C, then let sag back through the Bb to
// just under it as the melody arrives. The shape is the 1995 file's own
// pitch-wheel moves, read off it and written out in beats. Strings cannot
// bend, so it is Keen alone, the lead's crying synth voice.
section turn bars:4
  bass.figure dyn:mf feel:tight
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 f2:0.25 e2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 f2:0.25 e2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 |
  root dyn:mp
    | c2:16 |
  pad dyn:mp
    | [e3 a3 c4]:8 [e3 a3 c4 e4]:8 |
  lead.hold dyn:mp..mf
    | [a4 c5 e5]:12 r:4 |
  cry dyn:f bend:+200@0.4,+200@2,0@3.56,-40@3.9
    | r:12 bb5:4! |
  perc.fx dyn:mp
    | shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. |
    | shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. |
    | shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. |
    | shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. |

// The melody: two voices a third apart, a whole note a bar. No drums yet
// but the shaker, and a build in the last two bars.
section theme bars:16
  bass.figure dyn:mf feel:tight
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 f2:0.25 e2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 f2:0.25 e2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 f2:0.25 e2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 f2:0.25 e2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 f2:0.25 e2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 f2:0.25 e2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 f2:0.25 e2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 |
    | d1:0.25! a1:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 a1:0.25 f1:0.25 g1:0.25 a1:0.25 c2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 f2:0.25 e2:0.25 d2:0.25 c2:0.25 |
  root dyn:mf
    | d2:16 | a1:16 | bb1:16 | c2:16 |
  pad dyn:mp
    | [d3 f3 a3 d4]:16 | [e3 g3 c4]:16 |
    | [d3 f3 bb3]:16 | [e3 a3 c4]:16 |
  // The melody is played, not held. Same notes, same one-a-bar pulse the
  // original has - what changes is the bow. `^` swells a note under its
  // written level, up past it, and back before it releases, which the
  // strings can only do now that they are sent expression instead of the
  // mod wheel; see the layer controls in wayfarer.json. Not every bar
  // swells. A section that swelled on all sixteen would be as mechanical as
  // one that never did, so the bow moves on the notes a phrase arrives at
  // and rests on the notes between, and each four-bar phrase dies away on
  // its last. Bar 9's A is the high point of the section and the only note
  // taken with the bow already moving. The two voices sit behind the beat
  // and not by the same amount - the inner part leans later still, because
  // a section that speaks in perfect unison is one instrument rather than a
  // desk of players.
  lead.upper dyn:mp..mf art:sustain feel:loose pocket:lay
    | g4:4^ | f4:4_ | g4:4^ | f4:4. |
    | e4:4_ | f4:4_ | g4:4^ | e4:4. |
    | a4:4!^ | f4:4_ | g4:4^ | a4:4^ |
    | g4:4_ | f4:4_ | e4:4. | g4:4^ |
  lower dyn:mp..mf art:sustain feel:loose pocket:22
    | e4:4^ | d4:4_ | e4:4_ | d4:4. |
    | c4:4_ | d4:4_ | e4:4^ | c4:4. |
    | f4:4!^ | d4:4_ | e4:4_ | f4:4^ |
    | e4:4_ | d4:4_ | c4:4. | e4:4^ |
  perc.fx dyn:mp
    | shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. |
    | shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. |
    | shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25! shaker:0.25. shaker:0.25 shaker:0.25. |
