  // Second statement, and the change is the scoring rather than the volume.
  // The top line is the same bow as before, digging in at the head of each
  // phrase now that the kit is under it. The inner voice goes to tremolo:
  // the same notes, no longer held but shivering, which is how a section
  // puts unease under a melody that has not itself changed. That is the
  // whole difference between this pass and the first one.
